Kis folder mein kya jayega
Folder	Responsibility
backend/config/	Django settings, database connection, main URL routing aur deployment entry points.
backend/kernel/	Request ka immutable tenant context aur capability checks. models.py mein tenant roles aur user-role assignments jaise authorization records.
backend/tenancy/	Tenant, BusinessType aur Domain models. services.py hostname se active tenant resolve karega.
backend/websites/	Tenant ki website settings, content aur publish logic. Django Admin editing aur REST API dono shared services ke through validation aur access rules use karenge.
frontend/app/	Incoming hostname aur path se page request karega. Ek route multiple tenants ki websites serve karega.
frontend/templates/	React layouts aur template key se component ka mapping. classic/ pehla sample layout hai.
docs/	Aapke 22 principles, development phases, API contract aur approved architecture decisions.
